WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.910
Tasks & follow-up: the team's tasks with due times, reminders and Telegram alerts: a call, a message, a meeting, a payment, anything to do for a customer.

2
00:00:13.464 --> 00:00:21.890
At the top, switch between "Today", "Overdue", "All open" and "Done"; "Mine" shows only your own tasks.

3
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:33.280
Click "New task", write what is to be done in "What to do?", and pick the type (call, message, meeting…), due time, owner and customer.

4
00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:37.060
When it's done, tick it and it moves to "Done".

5
00:00:37.611 --> 00:00:44.290
"Urgent" tasks come first; a task past its due time turns red and its owner is alerted.

6
00:00:44.842 --> 00:00:51.420
A task with no due time gets no reminder; give every promise to a customer a due time.
